    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Let's start tiling!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Would it be possible to tile aperiodically with only one shape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This problem, called the Einstein Problem from the German \u201cein stein\u201d meaning one stone, was unsolved for many years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2022, David Smith finally discovered the einstein tile!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/extras/24ffa23a64dce4a074b061a1acfc5892.avif?t=1752321282\" width=256 height=221 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is based on the einstein tile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The imagination is limitless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own original background image by laying einstein tiles as you wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/extras/fd3d4691e0111e791349276850e9a537.poster.avif?t=1752321282\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/extras/fd3d4691e0111e791349276850e9a537.webm?t=1752321282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/extras/fd3d4691e0111e791349276850e9a537.mp4?t=1752321282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill the given frame with einstein tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a so-called jigsaw puzzle. There is no pattern, though.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/extras/686924042a567f95b0e22ca57d1d3762.poster.avif?t=1752321282\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/extras/686924042a567f95b0e22ca57d1d3762.webm?t=1752321282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/extras/686924042a567f95b0e22ca57d1d3762.mp4?t=1752321282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Photo and Video Submission Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether for commercial or non-commercial purposes, you are free to use this game's footage in YouTube videos, live streams, or on websites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Let's start tiling!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Would it be possible to tile aperiodically with only one shape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This problem, called the Einstein Problem from the German \u201cein stein\u201d meaning one stone, was unsolved for many years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2022, David Smith finally discovered the einstein tile!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/extras/24ffa23a64dce4a074b061a1acfc5892.avif?t=1752321282\" width=256 height=221 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is based on the einstein tile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The imagination is limitless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own original background image by laying einstein tiles as you wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/extras/fd3d4691e0111e791349276850e9a537.poster.avif?t=1752321282\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/extras/fd3d4691e0111e791349276850e9a537.webm?t=1752321282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/extras/fd3d4691e0111e791349276850e9a537.mp4?t=1752321282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill the given frame with einstein tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a so-called jigsaw puzzle. There is no pattern, though.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/extras/686924042a567f95b0e22ca57d1d3762.poster.avif?t=1752321282\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/extras/686924042a567f95b0e22ca57d1d3762.webm?t=1752321282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/extras/686924042a567f95b0e22ca57d1d3762.mp4?t=1752321282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Photo and Video Submission Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether for commercial or non-commercial purposes, you are free to use this game's footage in YouTube videos, live streams, or on websites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
